From: Carlos Ciconato <354919267+CarlosCiconato@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 11:32:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] LTFT on the Injection time (ms) table

In Injection time (ms) mode the long term trims learn and apply on the ms
table axes (RPM x MAP or TPS), and Apply writes into the ms table,
scaling only the pulse above the reference deadtime. TunerStudio shows
the trims on the ms table axes in that mode.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01TkhsyMr5ndz2MBCxuDZhPC
